load @term/seed/manifold/analytic
  find analytic-manifold

# A Taylor series: the expansion of a smooth function as an infinite polynomial in its derivatives at a point, the best
# polynomial approximation of every degree at once. A function equal to its Taylor series everywhere is analytic, the
# rigid smoothness where local data fixes the whole. The form carries the analytic manifold the function lives on.
form taylor-series
  link domain, like analytic-manifold
